WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,680
Hey, you say that as if I owe you something.

2
00:00:03,680 --> 00:00:06,880
Isn't it? Just tell us if we are your soldiers.

3
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:08,000
So what

4
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,360
Then if your soldiers become stronger, do you also become stronger?

5
00:00:11,360 --> 00:00:14,820
That's what it says

6
00:00:14,820 --> 00:00:18,980
After becoming stronger, lead us to do more battles. You will also have light and can advance to the finals.

7
00:00:18,980 --> 00:00:23,970
That makes sense too

8
00:00:23,970 --> 00:00:27,060
Then who do you think I train for?

9
00:00:27,060 --> 00:00:28,580
for myself

10
00:00:28,580 --> 00:00:32,450
Is it okay to pay a little for yourself?

11
00:00:32,450 --> 00:00:35,180
It's definitely fine for me

12
00:00:35,180 --> 00:00:36,460
Then why are you hesitating?

13
00:00:36,620 --> 00:00:45,820
Give me money. Wait. What are you waiting for?

14
00:00:45,820 --> 00:00:47,180
Only when you pay can you gain something

15
00:00:47,180 --> 00:00:49,500
If you invest one pound today, you will gain ten pounds next year

16
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:51,100
The more you invest, the more you gain

17
00:00:51,100 --> 00:00:52,140
and miss this opportunity

18
00:00:52,140 --> 00:00:53,980
Next time you want to invest, it won’t be like this.

19
00:00:53,980 --> 00:00:55,260
Let me tell you one more thing by the way

20
00:00:55,260 --> 00:00:56,380
The types of troops I trained are very powerful

21
00:00:56,380 --> 00:00:58,860
It has disappeared from history for hundreds of years. It really needs to be practiced.

22
00:00:58,860 --> 00:01:00,060
You're going to leave your name in history
